<div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小四 · 第 12 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">SquareArea與Perimeter</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">A=a² · P=4a · 65 min · 1-on-3 Online Lesson</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》4下A冊 單元七（續）<br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 必考</span> SquareArea/Perimeter係呈分試幾何題核心，每年必出<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>L11 Area概念 · RectangleArea · Perimeter複習<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ SquareArea公式 A=a² ❷ SquarePerimeter公式 P=4a ❸ 區分AreavsPerimeter ❹ 已知Area/Perimeter反求邊長<br/>
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 T34 Area用 a×4 · T35 給Perimeter求Area時用錯公式 · T36 單位混淆（cm vs cm²）
  </div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">📐 幾何探險家</div><div class="lf-game-desc">計算面積&體積，小心公式陷阱！三角形要除2、梯形上下底唔好調轉！</div><div class="lf-game-action">🔍 開始探險 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>Square邊長 4 cm。Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>Square邊長 4 cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>邊長 5 cm 的Square，Area=25 ___。單位應該係咩？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>SquarePerimeter = 24 cm。邊長 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>SquareArea = 49 cm²。邊長 = ？（提示：邊長×邊長=49）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：SquareArea公式 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>Square = 四邊相等的特殊Rectangle</b><br/>
      ② <b>Area = <div style="text-align:center;margin:12px 0;"><svg style="max-width:205px;width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:8px auto;" viewbox="0 0 205 195" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="125" rx="2" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="125" x="20" y="20"></rect>
<line stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5" x1="77.5" x2="87.5" y1="12" y2="12"></line>
<line stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5" x1="77.5" x2="87.5" y1="163" y2="163"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-dasharray="4,2" stroke-width="1" x1="20" x2="145" y1="35" y2="35"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="20" x2="20" y1="30" y2="40"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="145" x2="145" y1="30" y2="40"></line>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-family="Noto Sans HK,sans-serif" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="82.5" y="49">5 cm</text>
</svg></div>
邊長 × 邊長 = a²</b>（a 係邊長）<br/>
      ③ <b>Perimeter = 邊長 × 4 = 4a</b>（四邊加埋）<br/>
      ④ <b>致命對比：</b>邊長=5cm → Area=5×5=25cm² · Perimeter=5×4=20cm。完全唔同！<br/>
      ⑤ Area同Perimeter的單位：Area有 ²，Perimeter冇 ²
    </div>
</div>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:10px 0;">
<svg height="150" viewbox="0 0 500 150" width="500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<rect fill="#F0F9FF" height="120" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="120" x="40" y="15"></rect>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="28" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="100" y="80">A=a²</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="100" y="148">Area = a×a</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90,10,75)" x="10" y="75">a</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="100" y="10">a</text>
<rect fill="none" height="120" stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="8,3" stroke-width="4" width="120" x="260" y="15"></rect>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="24" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="80">P=4a</text>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="148">Perimeter = a+a+a+a</text>
<rect fill="#F0FDF4" height="50" stroke="#16A34A" stroke-width="3" width="50" x="400" y="30"></rect>
<text fill="#166534" font-size="18" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="425" y="60">?</text>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" x="425" y="100">邊長?=5</text>
<text fill="#16A34A" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="425" y="115">A=25 P=20</text>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：反求邊長 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🟡 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>已知Area求邊長：</b>搵一個數，自乘等於Area → 邊長 = √Area<br/>
        P4只要求簡單數字：Area=25→邊長=5（因為5×5=25）<br/>
      ② <b>已知Perimeter求邊長：</b>邊長 = Perimeter ÷ 4<br/>
      ③ <b>兩步題（Trap！）：</b>Question給Perimeter問Area → 要先從Perimeter求邊長，再求Area！
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例1</div><div class="lf-ex-q">Square邊長 8 cm。Area = ？Perimeter = ？</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">SquarePerimeter = 36 cm。邊長 = ？Area = ？</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">🪤 Trap引爆</div>Square邊長6cm。<br/>小明：Area=6×4=24<br/>小美：Area=6×6=36<br/>邊個啱？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ Revealed</div>小美啱！Area=邊長²=36cm²<br/>小明用咗Perimeter公式（6×4）<br/>呢個錯誤=扣3分=跌Grade</div>
</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 70%學生會將SquareArea計錯做 a×4！記住：4條邊加埋=Perimeter·邊長自己乘自己=Area。</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 已知Perimeter求Area = 兩步！例：P=32→a=8→A=64。唔好直接用32×任何嘢！</div>
</div>
