<div>
<div class="lf-h1">六、Common Error Summary （8 min）</div>
<div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ Self Check（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅Trap</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 Learning Objectives Review — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有Trap類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error（❌ Trap）</th><th>Correct Approach（✅）</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><b>Area用 a×4</b>：邊長5→A=20 ❌</td><td>A=a²=5×5=25cm²。a×4=Perimeter！</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><b>Perimeter用 a²</b>：邊長5→P=25 ❌</td><td>P=4a=4×5=20cm。Perimeter係四條邊加埋。</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><b>單位搞亂</b>：Area答案寫cm、Perimeter寫cm²</td><td>Area=cm²/m²。Perimeter=cm/m。有²同冇²要分清！</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><b>給Perimeter求Area直接代</b>：P=32→A=32×? ❌</td><td>先求邊長（32÷4=8），再求Area（8×8=64）→兩步！</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><b>Area求邊長用÷4</b>：A=36→邊長=36÷4=9 ❌</td><td>找邊長×邊長=36的數→6（6²=36）。唔係除！</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><b>邊長double=Areadouble</b>：2a→2A ❌</td><td>邊長×2→Area×4（因為(2a)²=4a²）。Area係邊長嘅平方！</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><b>Square當Rectangle計</b>：用A=l×w但l=w（都啱）</td><td>Square係特殊Rectangle，用A=a²最直接。兩者答案一樣。</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「正方四邊一樣長，Area a² Perimeter 4a。邊長二次方係Area，記得單位要有平方。」</div>
<div class="lf-h1">七、4-Step Problem Solving</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">1</div><div class="stitle">搵邊長a</div><div class="sdetail">Question直接俾a？定係要從Perimeter（÷4）或Area（開方）求？</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">2</div><div class="stitle">揀公式</div><div class="sdetail">搵Area→A=a²。搵Perimeter→P=4a。唔好調轉！</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">3</div><div class="stitle">計算</div><div class="sdetail">a²=a×a。心算或直式。大數字（例如80²=6400）要小心！</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">4</div><div class="stitle">配單位</div><div class="sdetail">Area→cm²/m²。Perimeter→cm/m。答案合理？Area通常大過Perimeter。</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-h1">附錄：考後加強練習（S1-S4）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th>答案</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S1</td><td>Square邊長 11 cm。(a) Perimeter = ？(b) Area = ？</td><td class="lf-ans">(a) 44cm (b) 121cm²</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S2</td><td>Square的Perimeter是 56 cm。它的Area是多少？</td><td class="lf-ans">56÷4=14cm → 14²=196cm²</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S3</td><td>一個Square和一個Rectangle的Perimeter相等。Square邊長 10 cm。Rectangle長 14 cm，闊 = ？</td><td class="lf-ans">40÷2−14=6cm</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S4</td><td>一個Square花圃的Area是 81 m²。(a) 邊長 = ？(b) Perimeter = ？(c) 如果每米籬笆 $8，圍住花圃要多少錢？</td><td class="lf-ans">(a) 9m (b) 36m (c) $288</td></tr>
</table>
